"Go","s":35.722,"e":35.85,"line":"c1","accent":false,"brk":true},{"w":"to","s":35.885,"e":35.954,"line":"c1","accent":false,"brk":false},{"w":"teyro","s":36.012,"e":36.279,"line":"c1","accent":false,"brk":false},{"w":"dot","s":36.338,"e":36.512,"line":"c1","accent":false,"brk":false},{"w":"app.","s":36.57,"e":37.197,"line":"c1","accent":true,"brk":false}],"lines":[{"id":"h1","start":0.12,"end":2.772,"text":"Vibe coding without the basics is just gambling."},{"id":"p1","start":2.872,"end":6.259,"text":"You type a prompt, hit regenerate, hit it again, and hope this one works."},{"id":"p2","start":6.359,"end":12.248,"text":"Developers know it. In Stack Overflow's 2026 survey, nearly half said they trust AI when they can check the answer."},{"id":"p3","start":12.348,"end":16.813,"text":"In last year's survey, 45 percent said debugging AI code takes them longer."},{"id":"v1","start":16.913,"end":19.989,"text":"Now picture reading what the AI wrote and spotting the bug in seconds."},{"id":"o1","start":20.089,"end":23.262,"text":"You know what every line does, because you practised lines like it yesterday."},{"id":"o2","start":23.362,"end":27.314,"text":"You write and fix real code in a few minutes a day, with instant feedback on every answer."},{"id":"o3","start":27.414,"end":29.79,"text":"And you come back tomorrow, because your streak is on the line."},{"id":"r1","start":29.89,"end":31.341,"text":"That's learning to code on Teyro."},{"id":"f1","start":31.441,"end":34.472,"text":"Short daily lessons, a path built for your goal, and it's free to start."},{"id":"c1","start":34.572,"end":36.907,"text":"Stop rolling the dice. Go to teyro dot app."}],"lip":{"amp":[0,0,0,0,0.769,1,1,0.998,1,0.838,0.818,0.356,0.203,0.318,0.384,1,1,1,0.985,1,1,1,1,1,0.656,0.668,1,0.607,0.445,0.831,0.88,0.451,0.037,0.557,0.688,0.427,0.038,1,1,1,1,0.716,0.581,0.555,1,1,1,0.161,0.301,0.649,0.691,0.603,0.496,0.557,0.59,0.886,0.968,0.981,0.896,0.785,0.378,0.713,0.99,0.979,0.685,0.606,0.223,0.793,0.81